# Place your icon files here:
#
# icon.ico  - Windows icon (256x256 recommended, can include multiple sizes)
# icon.png  - Linux icon (256x256 or 512x512 recommended)
#
# You can create these from a single source image using online converters
# or tools like ImageMagick:
#   convert icon.png -define icon:auto-resize=256,128,64,48,32,16 icon.ico
